Date: 2026-04-23
Descriptor: structural_equivalence (first experiment — validates ADR 0004)
Purpose:
    Run 0-hop profile-based equivalence classification on six canonical
    small graphs and record how identifiers partition. Purpose is to see
    whether signature = profile is expressive enough to support the next
    mechanism (pattern detection), or whether we need to upgrade to 1-hop.

Mechanism version:
    ADR 0004 (signature = IdentifierProfile, 0-hop).
    Source: v2/src/lib.rs at commit <this commit>.
    Runner: v2/examples/structural_equivalence.rs.

Command:
    cargo run --example structural_equivalence

